# Line endings: stored LF in the repo, checked out CRLF on every machine.
# AME/playbook files (playbook.conf, YAML tasks, .ps1/.cmd) must be CRLF in the packaged .apbx,
# and this makes that independent of the cloner's (or CI runner's) core.autocrlf setting.
# Subtree pulls of debloat-tool/: git -c merge.renormalize=true subtree pull ... (see debloat-tool/README.md)
* text=auto eol=crlf

*.apbx binary
*.cab binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
